# KPI Dictionary & Data Quality Contract

## Project Overview

This project focuses on converting ambiguous business requirements into clearly defined Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) and establishing data quality validation rules for retail order data.

## Objectives

* Define measurable business KPIs.
* Document KPI formulas and business rules.
* Identify missing, duplicate, and invalid data.
* Create data quality validation checks.
* Summarize findings and recommendations.

## Tools Used

* Python
* Google Colab
* Pandas
* GitHub

## Datasets

* Retail Orders Raw Dataset
* Retail Data Dictionary Dataset

## Project Status

Data exploration and initial code execution completed. Repository documentation and project files are being organized.
